COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."payments"."qbo_realm_id" IS 'QuickBooks company (realm) this payment''s qbo_payment_id belongs to. NULL on rows written before 20260808070000 — QBO payment ids are per-company counters, so a void/delete cleanup keyed on qbo_payment_id alone can collide across realms. NULL is treated as "unknown, still removable" so historical voids keep working.';



