COMMENT ON INDEX "public"."message_send_attempts_parent_fingerprint_key" IS 'Atomic per-part claim for contact-less child attempts (the multi-photo MMS split). Complements message_send_attempts_parent_recipient_key, which covers children carrying a recipient_contact_id; between them every child row under a parent has exactly one database-level uniqueness guard. Deliberately excludes contact-bearing children: group/broadcast fingerprints vary only by recipient phone, and two distinct contacts in one conversation may share a number.';



